# Build artifact. `make build` writes this; it is 4 MB and rebuilt from source,
# so it never belongs in history. Note that `go build ./...` type-checks without
# producing it — if a CLI change seems to have done nothing, the binary here is
# probably stale.
/docksmith

# Go test and coverage output
*.test
*.out
coverage.html

# Image archives produced by `docksmith save`
*.tar

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
